    "CardDescription": {
        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_herb_butter",
        "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_HerbButter_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "Butter worked through a ground mushroom or dried ginger. It tastes of the herb and keeps longer than plain butter."
    },
    "CardHelpSection": {
        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_herb_butter",
        "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_HerbButter_CardHelpSection",
        "DefaultText": "<b>Made from:</b> Drag Milk Butter or a Butter Chunk onto Black Trumpet Powder, Shiitake Powder, King Oyster Powder or Dried Ginger. The butter is used up. With Sirus23's Mod Collection, its fats (Butter, Cream and the like) work too.\n\n<b>Uses:</b> Eat it. It spoils far more slowly than plain butter."
    },
